# Combine positive and negative

variable C1${dir} equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(23421.2490788089+${C1pos})
variable C13 equal 0.5*(23421.2490788089+-23089.1100160481)
